<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github.asafelobotomy.uqview</id>
  <name>uQview</name>
  <summary>View pictures, mark them up and set them as your wallpaper</summary>
  <description>
    <p>uQview is a fast picture viewer for the uQ desktop. Pictures open in tabs in one window, in uQ&#x27;s theme.</p>
    <p>Mark up a screenshot with arrows, boxes, text and highlights, then save or copy it, or set any picture as the wallpaper.</p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.asafelobotomy.uqview.desktop</launchable>
